The DevTeam is pretty good at giving prices that reflect
the real value of an item.  Whip costs 4, broad pick 50.

Now let's look at how hard each weapon hits:

Pick-axe
pick-axe         d6  3.5 d3     2
dwarvish mattock d12 6.5 d8+2d6 11.5

Whip
bullwhip         d2  1.5 1      1
